# Files that must stay LF even on Windows checkouts (autocrlf=true would
# otherwise CRLF them): bash executed by Git Bash, and clitest files whose
# expected-output matching is byte-exact. (Story 4.8, #117 — the Windows
# clone now runs the pre-commit hook.)
.githooks/* text eol=lf
tests/*.clitest.txt text eol=lf
.local/bin/setup/vm-harness-seed text eol=lf
